  "tag": "r1",
  "purpose": "HBM d4g (plan b) PHY-side host configuration/status leaf, one master (ot_hbm_host_cfg_leaf2 = ot_hbm_host_cfg_leaf NCP 2, copy A on W / copy B on E) for the 4 quadrant leaves hleaf_<q>: flop-first F20 bundle pins -> 2 replicated equal-age copy groups (CFG_LAT 2), per-target ready/active/fault fan-in pin flop -> output flop (ST_LAT 2), synced rst_n (ot_rst_relay 2+1). NT 20 / NF 32 covers the d4f mapping (max 19 / 29 per quadrant). Lockstep vs d4f direct ingress->targets + mutants.",
  "extra_paths": [
   "rtl/hbm_accel/host_static_20261015/ot_hbm_host_cfg_leaf.sv",
   "rtl/hbm_accel/host_static_20261015/tb_hbm_host_cfg_leaf_lockstep.sv",
